{
  "label": "Bulk Reassign",
  "category": "Alert Issuer",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Bulk Reassign Management",
      "id": "bulk-reassign",
      "intro": "Bulk Reassign memungkinkan supervisor untuk memindahkan multiple alerts dari investigator lama ke investigator baru. Berguna ketika investigator cuti, resign, atau untuk load balancing workload.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Apa itu Bulk Reassign?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Transfer alerts dari investigator lama ke investigator baru\n• Hanya alerts yang ter-assign yang bisa di-reassign\n• Wajib isi reason untuk audit trail\n• Track previous assignee untuk history\n• Support partial reassignment dengan feedback detail",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.05),0 10px 30px rgba(99,102,241,.12);border:1px solid #c7d2fe;\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f1 0%,#4f46e5 50%,#4338ca 100%);padding:18px 20px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.15) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:18px 18px;\"></div><div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M13 5a4 4 0 010 7.75M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75M21 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.01em;\">Bulk Reassign</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);margin-top:2px;\">Transfer Alert Ownership</div></div></div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:14px 16px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #6366f1;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">Investigator A</span><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #10b981;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#10b981;\">Investigator B</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Aktivasi Bulk Reassign Mode",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik button **Actions** di toolbar\n• Pilih **Bulk Reassign**\n• Sistem akan auto-fetch alerts yang bisa di-reassign:\n  - Default: alerts yang assigned ke current user (diri sendiri)\n  - Bisa ganti filter untuk lihat alerts investigator lain\n• Page akan switch ke reassign selection mode\n• List akan hanya tampilkan alerts yang eligible",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #fffbeb;background:linear-gradient(to right,#fffbeb,#fef3c7);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f59e0b;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">REASSIGN MODE</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Select alerts to reassign</span></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Filter by Current Assignee</div><select style=\"width:100%;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;\"><option>My Alerts (John Analyst)</option><option>Sarah Investigator</option></select></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Select Alerts untuk Reassign",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Centang alerts yang ingin di-reassign\n• Counter akan update di toolbar\n• Bisa filter by investigator lama untuk lihat workload specific investigator\n• Alerts yang locked oleh investigator lain tidak bisa di-reassign\n• System akan fetch data real-time dari API",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f3ff;background:linear-gradient(to right,#eef2ff,#f5f3ff);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Selected for reassignment</span></div><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#8b5cf6;\">4 Selected</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked style=\"width:14px;height:14px;\"/><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Alert #12345</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Currently: John Analyst • Score: 85</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Submit Reassignment dengan Reason",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik button **Reassign Selected (X)**\n• Dialog muncul dengan 3 field wajib:\n  - **From**: Investigator lama (auto-filled, read-only)\n  - **New Assignee**: Pilih investigator baru dari dropdown\n  - **Reason**: Wajib isi reason untuk audit (contoh: \"Load balancing\", \"Investigator on leave\")\n• Klik **Submit** untuk process\n• System akan:\n  - Update assignedTo ke investigator baru\n  - Save previousAssignee\n  - Set isReassigned flag = true\n  - Log reason ke audit trail",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #99f6e4;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0fdfa;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Bulk Reassign - 4 Alerts</span><button style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#14b8a6;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;\">Submit</button></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">From (Current Assignee)</div><input value=\"John Analyst\" disabled style=\"width:100%;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b;\"/></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">New Assignee *</div><select style=\"width:100%;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;\"><option>Select New Investigator...</option><option>Sarah Investigator</option></select></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Reason *</div><textarea style=\"width:100%;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:9px;resize:none;\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"e.g. Load balancing, Investigator on leave...\"></textarea></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Tracking & Response",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Setiap alert yang di-reassign akan memiliki:\n  - **previousAssignee**: Nama investigator lama\n  - **isReassigned**: Flag true\n  - **assignedDate**: Update ke timestamp reassignment\n  - **reassignReason**: Tersimpan di audit log\n• Notification:\n  - **Success**: \"Successfully reassigned X alerts\"\n  - **Partial**: Detail success/failed count dengan IDs\n  - **Failed**: Error message dengan reason\n• Auto refresh setelah submit",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;display:grid;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 11-5.93-9.14\"/><path d=\"M22 4L12 14.01l-3-3\"/></svg><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#15803d;\">Success</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#166534;margin-top:1px;\">Successfully reassigned 4 alerts from John to Sarah</div></div></div><div style=\"border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fcd34d;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 001.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 001.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 00-3.42 0z\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4M12 17h.01\"/></svg><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#d97706;\">Partial Success</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#92400e;margin-top:1px;\">3 reassigned, 1 failed (#12345: Alert is locked)</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
